---
description: Environment configuration standards.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Environment Variables

Never commit real secrets.

Always provide:

.env.example

---

# Configuration

Separate configuration by environment:

Development

Testing

Staging

Production

---

# Naming

Frontend

NEXT_PUBLIC_

Backend

APP_

DB_

JWT_

REDIS_

SMTP_

STORAGE_

---

# Validation

Validate required environment variables during startup.

Fail fast if critical configuration is missing.

---

# Secrets

Never expose:

Database password

JWT Secret

SMTP Password

API Keys

Private Tokens

---

# Local Development

Local setup should require minimal manual configuration.

Document every required variable.

---

# Goal

Configuration should be predictable,

secure,

and portable.